{"4069490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pix Eliz Great Trilogy", "steam_appid": 4069490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pix Eliz Great Trilogy, it's three remakes, and three remasters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of a pocket sized metroidvania in Pix Eliz Great Tiny Adventure, the first episode of the adventures of Pix Eliz, who unwillingly felt deep within a temple localised in the past!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a unique gameplay system in Pix Eliz Great Curse Of The Cards, the second episode in which the poor lady got cursed and can only move by using weird cards! Use that curse to your advantage while seeking the 6 parts of the only card that would allow you to lift that awful curse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, discover the vast inside of a subterrean gorge in Pix Eliz Junior And The Great Vesicle, third episode in which you'll follow the young lady within the deep unknowns of earth! A weird place with strange effects... And maybe, just maybe, you might also find an exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if all of this isn't enough to fullfill your wish for adventure, then maybe you need more archeological work, which is great! Because the original versions of the three games, originally made for game jams, are here, remastered to fix all bugs and porting issues! It even brings a secundary objective with the presence of three medals parts! Videogame preservation as it's best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wether you love exploration, original gameplays, traditionnal platformers, or small puzzle, Pix Eliz Great Trilogy has something for you!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pix Eliz Great Trilogy, it's three remakes, and three remasters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of a pocket sized metroidvania in Pix Eliz Great Tiny Adventure, the first episode of the adventures of Pix Eliz, who unwillingly felt deep within a temple localised in the past!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a unique gameplay system in Pix Eliz Great Curse Of The Cards, the second episode in which the poor lady got cursed and can only move by using weird cards! Use that curse to your advantage while seeking the 6 parts of the only card that would allow you to lift that awful curse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, discover the vast inside of a subterrean gorge in Pix Eliz Junior And The Great Vesicle, third episode in which you'll follow the young lady within the deep unknowns of earth! A weird place with strange effects... And maybe, just maybe, you might also find an exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if all of this isn't enough to fullfill your wish for adventure, then maybe you need more archeological work, which is great! Because the original versions of the three games, originally made for game jams, are here, remastered to fix all bugs and porting issues! It even brings a secundary objective with the presence of three medals parts! Videogame preservation as it's best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wether you love exploration, original gameplays, traditionnal platformers, or small puzzle, Pix Eliz Great Trilogy has something for you!</p>", "short_description": "Three quality games in one package! A short but sweet metroidvania with Pix Eliz 1, a unique mix of card game and platforming in Pix Eliz 2, and an adventurous platformer which constantly renew itself in Pix Eliz 3! Playable in english and in french!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audi